Description: Wild OS Music
 Music plays the songs in the Music folder in your home folder: by song,
 album, artist or folder, with playlists, liked songs and a mini player
 that stays on top. It reads tags, cover art and lyrics from the files,
 keeps playlists as .m3u8 files any player can open, and shows in the
 media controls so the keyboard's media keys work. Nothing is streamed or
 looked up online: no accounts and no tracking.
